; A row normalization (LayerNorm or RmsNorm over a row's last axis) as data:
; rows, width, eps, which affine operands are present, strides and the
; precision, with the binary32 reference its generated loops are checked
; against. Pure: no SSA, no tensor type, so the SSA builder, the attention
; layer's descriptor and its tests share one definition. js_of_ocaml-safe:
; every extent and stride is an [int64].

(library
 (name norm_block)
